## Third-party data licences

This licence covers the source code in this repository only. The datasets the
software accesses via Google Earth Engine remain subject to their own terms:

| Dataset | Licence / terms |
|---|---|
| Google Open Buildings v3 (polygons) | CC BY 4.0 |
| Google Open Buildings 2.5D Temporal v1 | CC BY 4.0 |
| ECMWF ERA5-Land Hourly | Copernicus Licence |
| ECMWF ERA5 Hourly | Copernicus Licence |
| NASA MODIS MOD11A2 (LST) | NASA open data |
| NASA MODIS MCD19A2 (MAIAC AOD) | NASA open data |
| USGS SRTMGL1 v003 | Public domain |
| FABDEM | CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (non-commercial) |

Validation reference data:

| Source | Licence / terms |
|---|---|
| NASA POWER | NASA open data |
| Global Solar Atlas (Solargis / World Bank ESMAP) | CC BY 4.0 |

Earth Engine use is additionally subject to the Google Earth Engine Terms of
Service and requires a registered Cloud project.
